      "text": "A vertical strip of five thumbnail images on the right side of Fig. A2.1 (‘NHWA data cycle’) illustrating the five data dissemination outputs paired with the labels alongside them: (1) cover thumbnails of WHO health workforce publications for ‘National, regional and global reports’; (2) a screenshot of the interactive NHWA portal interface with world map and charts for ‘NHWA data portal’; (3) a banner graphic for ‘World Health Data Hub’; (4) the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals emblem and colour wheel for ‘UN SDG database’; and (5) a summary chart graphic for ‘GPW14 reporting’.",
